            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"interaction-depth-is-the-main-latency-lever\">Interaction depth is the main latency lever</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The matched 256-pixel sweep isolates the number of\nvision-language interaction layers. Moving from zero to eight\nlayers adds 4.836 ms and 18.95 million parameters, while every\nmeasured depth still clears 71 Hz.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 330\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"white\"/><line x1=\"75\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"730\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#333\"/><line x1=\"75\" y1=\"25\" x2=\"75\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#333\"/><polyline points=\"75.0,239.3 238.8,199.0 402.5,156.8 566.2,120.0 730.0,60.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"75.0\" cy=\"239.3\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2563eb\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"227.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1f2937\">9.111</text><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#444\">0</text><circle cx=\"238.8\" cy=\"199.0\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2563eb\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"238.8\" y=\"187.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1f2937\">10.203</text><text x=\"238.8\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#444\">2</text><circle cx=\"402.5\" cy=\"156.8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2563eb\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"402.5\" y=\"144.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1f2937\">11.345</text><text x=\"402.5\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#444\">4</text><circle cx