            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"gpu-time-and-wall-time-answer-different-questions\">GPU time and wall time answer different questions</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Blue segments are the range of per-replica GPU-event medians.\nOrange segments include preprocessing and CPU scheduling.\nNarrow blue ranges establish stable model execution; broad\norange ranges diagnose cluster-side contention rather than a\nslower neural network.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 285\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"white\"/><text x=\"138\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\">N6 / 256</text><line x1=\"219.7\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"222.9\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"235.2\" y1=\"67\" x2=\"590.4\" y2=\"67\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"230.9\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\">GPU 12.2\u201312.8</text><text x=\"586.4\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\">wall 14.9\u201377.3</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\">N2 / 512</text><line x1=\"206.7\" y1=\"118\" x2=\"215.4\" y2=\"118\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"228.8\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"668.2\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"223.4\" y=\"122\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\">GPU 10.0\u201311.5</text><text x=\"664.2\" y=\"149\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\">wall 13.8\u201390.9</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\">N6 / 512</text><line x1=\"22